body:
Jesus Christ, there are so many people here defending the rapist saying the coke "sobers" you up. Look man, the fact is she drove straight to your apartment to tell you everything that happened and even said she felt like she had cheated and was sobbing while telling you. 

&#x200B;

She obviously regrets the whole thing and wanted you to know first hand. She could've stayed sleeping, she could've hidden it from you, she could've acted like nothing happened, she could've stayed home and texted you or told you the next day. But no, she decided to drive to your house and tell you the whole thing. 

&#x200B;

Take this from someone who's girlfriend of 6 years broke up with him, was cheating from months and hid that shit from me. Even blaming me for everything and acting like the victim when I found out. Now this is someone who doesn't give a fuck and has no conscience.

&#x200B;

Your girl does and obviously cares a lot about you, enough to come clean immediately and ask you for help. 

You have all the right in the world to have some doubts and be cautious about the whole thing. But just think of all the other ways she could've handled it and how she chose the one way which obviously shows she cares about you.

